    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-deptpositions01",
    "name": "univ-v2-department-positions",
    "description": "Department + department positions APIs.\n\n## Create order (no `/departmentStructure`)\n1. `POST /department/` — create dept (`parentDepartmentId`) OR insert parent above child (send `departmentId`)\n2. `POST /departmentPosition/` — position seat (`level`, optional `departmentId`)\n3. `POST /departmentPosition/head` — assign person (`userId`; status defaults to ACTIVE)\n4. `GET /departmentPosition/cards` | `/tree` | `/chart`\n\nDepartment hierarchy lives on `department.parentDepartmentId` (replaces removed `department_structure` table).\n\nPre-request scripts build JSON from collection variables.\n\nSet `baseurl` + `token`. Permissions: DEPARTMENT_*.\n\n**Removed:** `/departmentStructure`, `/subAccount`, `departmentStructureId`, `accountId`, `subAccountId`.\n\nDocs: `DEPARTMENT_POSITIONS_NAMING_CONVENTION.md`, `AFFECTED_APIS_DEPARTMENT_CONSOLIDATION.md`, `DEPARTMENT_POSITIONS_POSTMAN.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
