            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/departmentPosition/cards?changePeriod=week",
              "host": [
                "{{baseurl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "departmentPosition",
                "cards"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "changePeriod",
                  "value": "week",
                  "description": "optional — week (default) | month | year"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**GET /departmentPosition/cards**\n\n### Query (optional)\n| Name | Type | Default | Values |\n|------|------|---------|--------|\n| `changePeriod` | string | `week` | `week`, `month`, `year` |\n\nCompares current counts vs baseline:\n- `week` — 7 days ago\n- `month` — same calendar date 1 month ago\n- `year` — same calendar date 1 year ago\n\nReturns:\n- `changePeriod` — period applied\n- `totalPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `filledPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `vacantPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `departments` `{ count, changePercent }` (`changePercent` always `null`)\n- `reportingLevels` `{ count, changePercent }` (`changePercent` always `null`)\n\n### `changePercent`\n\n`((currentCount - previousCount) / previousCount) × 100`\n\n- `previousCount` = positions that existed as of the cutoff (`createdAt <= cutoff`)\n- If `previousCount === 0` and `currentCount > 0` → `100`\n- If both `0` → `0`\n- Rounded to 1 decimal"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
